United Airlines on behalf of\nBritish Airways.\n6 BA285 will not operate on Mondays and Tuesdays from May 1 through May 15.\n• BA003 will not operate between July 30 and August 29.\n8 From May 1 through June 24, BA173 will depart New York at 1130 and arrive in New York\n9 BA239 will only operate on Wednesdays from June 28 through October 4.\n1 From May 1 through June 24, BA183 will operate as BA173 with the same timings.\nFor reservations and information telephone: London (01) 897-4000, Glasgow (041) 332-9666\nManchester (061) 228-6311.\nSchedules subject to change without notice."
